- (4,2): C[0]=4, but col 0 has only 3 empty cells in rows 0,1,3 (row 4 empty). **Infeasible.**

**C[1]=3:** R[0]+R[2]=7. Options (3,4) or (4,3).
- (3,4): C[3]=4, same problem as above. **Infeasible.**
- (4,3): C[0]=3, C[3]=3. Col 0 has exactly 3 available cells (rows 0,1,3) → all filled. Col 3 has exactly 3 available (rows 1,2,3) → all filled. **Feasible!**

## Constructing the Valid Configuration

With R[0]=4, R[1]=2, R[2]=3, R[3]=3, R[4]=0 and C[0]=3, C[1]=3, C[2]=1, C[3]=3, C[4]=2:

